{
  "slug": "mobazha",
  "name": "Mobazha",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI skills for Mobazha decentralized commerce platform. Guides you through deploying self-hosted stores on VPS (Docker or native binary), importing products from Shopify/Amazon/Etsy, configuring custom domains and Telegram bots, setting up Tor privacy, and managing your store via MCP tools. Zero commissions, built-in escrow, crypto + fiat payments.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **15 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (15): `competitor-analysis` (Analyze competitor products, reviews, and pricing to inform your Mobazha store strategy), `native-install` (Install the Mobazha native binary on Linux, macOS, or Windows), `product-description` (Generate SEO-optimized, conversion-focused product descriptions for your Mobazha store), `product-image-prompt` (Craft effective AI image generation prompts for product photography, store branding, and marketing visuals), `product-import` (Import products from Shopify, Amazon, Etsy, or CSV into a Mobazha store), `standalone-setup` (Deploy a self-hosted Mobazha store on any Linux VPS using Docker), `store-copywriting` (Write clear, credible, conversion-focused copy for your Mobazha store pages — storefront, About, banners, and campaigns), `store-management` (Manage a Mobazha store using MCP tools — products, orders, messages, and settings), and 7 more\n- **Hooks** (1): `0`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mobazha@claude-community` from `mobazha/mobazha-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "opencode"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 15,
    "hook": 1
  },
